From a9cc779a0ba18662f83baa460bb059a1025cc0da Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: cleanup <cleanup@local>
Date: Fri, 20 Nov 2026 22:14:02 +0000
Subject: [PATCH] Clean up shell: fix bang injection, drop dead
 code/settings/python, Escape closes popups

- launcher: pass bang {query} to sh as "$1" instead of splicing into the script
- remove Python helpers (search/OCR/calendar now come from hydrogen), qs-osd, stale shell backups
- remove dead OSD / NotificationCenter plumbing; status toasts via notify-send (Notify.qml),
  Control Center notifications tab drives swaync-client
- Config.qml keeps only settings the shell reads; drop Hister/AI leftovers
- Caffeine module watches its flag file instead of polling every 3s; clock bound to SystemClock
- PopupBase: Escape dismisses (Wi-Fi password prompt cancels first)
- add Makefile for C helpers, .gitignore, update docs
